              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BJTravis"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made 2 small changes: I used dried cranberries instead of the raisins and I used multi grain Cheerios for the cereal. These bars are wonderful. They are easy to make and are great for lunch boxes. Thank you for sharing the recipe :)",
